   "lines": [
    "When the loved slept, in",
    "brighter homes to waken,",
    "Where their pale brows with",
    "spirit wreaths are crowned;",
    "",
    "Large are the mansions in",
    "my Father's dwelling,",
    "Happy the homes which",
    "sorrows never dim,",
    "Sweet is the harp in",
    "holy music swelling,",
    "Glad are the tones which",
    "raise the heavenly hymn.",
    "",
    "There, like an Eden blos-",
    "-soming in gladness,",
    "Bloom the fair flowers this",
    "earth too rudely pressed;"
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "high",
   "note": "Continues hymn from previous page (entry begun April 18)."
